abstract: >-
  Cellular Mode is an open-source method and software architecture for
  bounded, resumable, auditable, and verifiable agent-assisted software
  engineering. It organizes work into explicit cells with persistent state,
  human authorization, final-state verification, optional adaptive and
  observer modules, and a plugin architecture including the Universal Plugin
  Protocol.
